- [README.md](/var/folders/_6/gpmy4q4166xbmb7153p4cqp80000gn/T/frontend-architect-accessible-dialog-primitive-candidate-wofqqr31/README.md) — 公开 API、实现边界、测试矩阵和三产品渐进迁移方案
